---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How INNEX Engineering handles information submitted through this website, including contact form submissions processed by Formspree."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <section class="section container prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This website itself does not set advertising or analytics cookies.</p>
    <h2>Information you submit</h2>
    <p>When you submit the contact form, the information you enter (name, firm, email, phone, and case details) is transmitted to and stored by Formspree, a third-party form processing service, under <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy">Formspree's privacy policy</a>, and delivered to INNEX Engineering by email. Formspree's confirmation and spam-check pages may use Google reCAPTCHA, which is subject to Google's own privacy terms. Your information is used only to respond to your inquiry and evaluate a potential engagement. It is not sold or shared for marketing.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log visitor IP addresses for security and operational purposes.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
